[== counter.mtron — a boot-style module, mirroring boot/space/*.mtron.
    Pulled through a cross-file feed (<test:module/counter.mtron>()), the body
    must evaluate exactly once per pull.  Every application writes an
    incrementing marker into the test: space; the historical double-eval bug
    (fsSpaceTest#testModulePullEvaluatesOnce) would bump the count to 2. ==]
||inst?counter<=uri(){
  test:scratch/count -> !*test:scratch/count.else(0) + 1
}
